@startuml
title SC-ORD-001 — Order confirmed
actor Customer as C
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP
participant "Cart" as K
participant "Notification" as N

C -> O : PlaceOrder
O --> C : accepted, order PENDING
note over O : RESERVING_STOCK
O ->> I : ReserveStock
I ->> O : StockReserved
note over O : CHARGING_PAYMENT
O ->> P : ChargePayment
P -> PSP : charge
PSP --> P : captured
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : CONFIRMING_STOCK
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CONFIRMED
O ->> K : OrderConfirmed
note over K : removes the ordered\nquantities, once
O ->> N : OrderConfirmed
N ->> C : confirmation e-mail
@enduml
